.nh
.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-limits - Account limits and usage; how to raise them (support ticket)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro limits [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Account limits: every limit of your account with the current usage (new-account limit of the prepaid cloud,
Gyro Cloud Istanbul servers, templates, additional IPs and disks per server, API order caps, keys, webhooks,
firewall rules and security groups, storage buckets and keys, DNS zones, container plans, Gyro Pipeline,
uptime monitors, projects).

.PP
Limits are raised on request: open a support ticket.
  gyro ticket create --department-id 3 --subject "Limit increase: " --message "Requested limit: \&. Reason: ..."
Plan limits (buckets, zones, container services ...) also grow with a bigger plan or an add-on.
When a command is refused because of a limit, the error shows the limit, the usage and the ready ticket command.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--fresh\fP[=false]
	read again (answers are cached for 60 s)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for limits


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	log HTTP requests to stderr (secrets masked)

.PP
\fB--lang\fP=""
	message language: tr or en (default from locale)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable colours (also NO_COLOR)

.PP
\fB--no-header\fP[=false]
	omit the table header

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	output format: table, json, yaml, text

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to use (env GYRO_PROFILE)

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath query applied to the result

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	print only ids

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=0s
	overall timeout, e.g. 30s, 10m

.PP
\fB--wide\fP[=false]
	show all table columns

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	do not ask for confirmation


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gyro limits
  gyro limits -o json --query "limits[?key=='compute.max_vms']"
  gyro ticket create --department-id 3 --subject "Limit increase: new_account.servers" --message "Requested limit: 10. Reason: ..."
.EE


